Z||000000||isthiswhereiputausername?||10-17-2001||02:16 PM||||Yes, the sound of that might have made you cringed..but has anyone tried a neon sport spolier on a notchback fiero?<P>I came across a shiny red one sitting on "half" a neon at the wreckers.. few scratches that may be able to be buffed out..<BR>(I can get it for about $35 Canadian)<P>Would it look good or bad I wonder?<P>heres a photo of one, but its not too clear..<P>  <IMG SRC="http://abacus.sj.ipixmedia.com/abc/M28/79ca1d13e9931e0c012be75166/i-1.JPG">  <P>They also have a more square one with the wing tips off a neon, but one of the tips is broke off and would need repair..<P><BR>Or does anyone have any suggestions on spoilers that look good on fieros?<P>Thanks!<BR><p>[This message has been edited by isthiswhereiputausername? (edited 10-17-2001).]||||reg||5
