Z||000003||Darren's 87 coupe||10-17-2001||10:13 PM||||i hear that a wing off of a firebird looks good, but i don't know if it's cheaper or not?  They look like they would be to big, but they're not.  So i've heard.  I plan on checking it out in a few months for mine.  Might be a little easier to find a firebird in the boneyard than a fiero.  It's not a very original look though and maybe that's more what your looking for.  What ever you decide on, make sure to get a pic to me when you get one.  Thanks<BR>Darren||||reg||1
